     "id": "ep44-map-quiz-1",
     "sourceNodeId": "n004",
     "speaker": "narrator",
     "textEn": "\"My kingdom suffered a horrible drought five years ago. Crops wouldn't grow, and my people were starving. One day a Daoist arrived in the kingdom. He said he had great powers and could pray for rain.\"",
     "textZh": "\"五年前,我的王国遭遇了严重的旱灾。庄稼无法生长,百姓们濒临饥饿。有一天,一位道教徒来到了这个王国。他声称自己拥有强大的法力,能够祈求降雨。\"",
     "audioRef": "sent_en:\"My kingdom suffered a horrible drought five years ago. Crops wouldn't grow, and my people were starving. One day a Daoist arrived in the kingdom. He said he had great powers and could pray for rain.\"",
     "audioStart": 25.807,
     "audioEnd": 43.18
    }
